/Title (Through their collaborative work, Karen and Erica bring together Indigenous and Western ways of knowing, being, and doing, showing how research can be shaped through respect, relationship-building, and shared learning. Together, their work reflects Etuaptmumk in practice by creating space for different knowledge systems to inform research, teaching, and community-engaged collaboration.)
